WEBVTT

00:09:59.678 --> 00:10:00.888
it was villainized.

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:05.434
Mainstream media weaponized break dancing
by connecting it to gang activity

00:10:05.434 --> 00:10:06.435
and violence.

00:10:06.810 --> 00:10:08.270
As an art form and subculture,

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:09.605
it wasn’t taken seriously.

00:10:10.689 --> 00:10:11.982
Fast-forward to today,

00:10:11.982 --> 00:10:13.901
break dancing is now an Olympic sport.

00:10:15.402 --> 00:10:17.196
What will be the future of twerking?

00:10:18.238 --> 00:10:20.074
Russian ballet dancers are twerking.

00:10:20.449 --> 00:10:21.450
Have you seen it?

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:22.451
They  be like this.

00:10:23.952 --> 00:10:25.162
Y’all think I’m playing.

00:10:25.162 --> 00:10:26.372
They’re out there like --

00:10:26.372 --> 00:10:27.623
(Singing) Doo doo doo doo.

00:10:27.623 --> 00:10:29.500
(Laughter)

00:10:29.833 --> 00:10:31.293
Can we clear Tchaikovsky?